   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<ul>\n<li><p><strong>Move and sync data.</strong> Deploy <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/quickstart/deploy-airbyte\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Airbyte Core</a> or <a href=\"https://cloud.airbyte.com/signup\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sign up for Airbyte Cloud</a> and follow the <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/cloud/getting-started-with-airbyte-cloud\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cloud getting started guide</a>. Choose from <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">700+ connectors</a> for APIs, databases, warehouses, lakes, and other data systems.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Work with Airbyte from your AI agent through the Airbyte MCP.</strong> Your AI agent (Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, VS Code Copilot, and many others) can build and manage data pipelines, troubleshoot syncs, read logs, and answer questions about Airbyte. Start with the <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/platform/airbyte-mcp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">overview</a>; for Airbyte Cloud, connect to the hosted server at <code>https://mcp.airbyte.com/mcp</code> and sign in with OAuth using the <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/platform/airbyte-mcp/install\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cloud setup guide</a>. For Airbyte Core deployments, the <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/platform/airbyte-mcp/self-managed\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">self-managed setup</a> runs locally against your deployment's API. See the available <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/platform/airbyte-mcp/tools\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tools</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Call APIs and search data directly (Airbyte Cloud only).</strong> Through the <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/platform/context-layer\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">context layer</a>, AI agents can read live data from supported sources and query supported destinations such as BigQuery and Snowflake without waiting for a sync, and search your data. This is available only in Airbyte Cloud; direct reads are read-only.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Build connectors and orchestrate pipelines.</strong> Create connectors with the <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/connector-development/connector-builder-ui/overview\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">no-code Connector Builder</a> or <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/connector-development/config-based/low-code-cdk-overview\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">low-code CDK</a>, and explore popular use cases in our <a href=\"https://airbyte.com/tutorials\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tutorials</a>. Orchestrate Airbyte syncs with <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/operator-guides/using-the-airflow-airbyte-operator\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Airflow</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/operator-guides/using-dagster-integration\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dagster</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/operator-guides/using-kestra-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kestra</a>, or the <a href=\"https://reference.airbyte.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Airbyte API</a>. You can also do this through the Airbyte MCP: your AI agent can publish and update custom connector manifests, run and cancel syncs, and change connection schedules.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Try it out yourself with our <a href=\"https://demo.airbyte.io/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">demo app</a>, visit our <a href=\"https://docs.airbyte.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">full documentation</a>, and learn more about <a href=\"https://airbyte.com/blog-categories/company-updates\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">recent announcements</a>. See our <a href=\"https://connectors.airbyte.com/files/generated_reports/connector_registry_report.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">registry</a> for a full list of connectors already available in Airbyte or Airbyte Cloud.</p>",
